**Definition 156.1 (Unrestricted support calculation).** For a nonnegative
row vector $y=(y_j)_{j=0}^{189}$ define

$$
g^C_{S,c}(r)=\sum_{j:c_C(b_j,S)=c}y_j\mathbf1_{r\in E_j},\quad
M^C_{S,c}=\max_{0\le r\le6}g^C_{S,c}(r),\quad
B_C(y)=\max_S\sum_cM^C_{S,c}.
\tag{156.1}
$$

